# GRADE — Vite frontend
#
# Copy to `.env` or `.env.local` in this folder (same level as package.json).
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser.
#
# When the UI is opened as a static build or from a host without the dev proxy,
# set the public API base URL (no trailing slash). Dev server with default proxy
# can leave this unset.
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Gemini / LLM grading is NOT configured here — the browser must never receive the key.
# On the API machine, use the repository root .env (see root .env.example):
#   GRADE_ENABLE_LLM=true
#   GRADE_GEMINI_API_KEY=...
#   GRADE_LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash   # optional
# Then restart uvicorn. The Evaluate page calls POST /evaluate on the API.
